          "jcr:created": "Fri Jul 29 2022 14:43:59 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>“I’m honored to be stepping into this role with the association,” said Collings. “APACMed is a vital voice of our industry because together, we have this unique opportunity to help shape policies and redefine healthcare on a larger scale. I look forward to building on a great foundation and seek new opportunities with all our industry partners to help improve patients’ lives across the region.”&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://apacmed.org/asia-pacific-medical-technology-association-apacmed-representing-the-medical-device-industry-in-asia-pacific-appoints-new-chairman-mr-john-collings-effective-1-august-2022/\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">Read the full news release here.</span></a></p>\n",
